I am sitting at my desk in the office on a Wednesday morning.
Eva walks over to my desk with a cup of coffee.
"Hi Maya, do you have time on Friday?" she asks with a big smile.
I think that I actually have a free evening.
"Yes, I have plenty of time," I answer her.
"I would really like to invite you home for dinner," she says.
I become very happy about the invitation.
"Thank you, I will really gladly come," I say.
"I intend to make a vegetarian dish," Eva explains.
"That sounds absolutely perfect," I smile.
"What time shall I be there?" I ask.
"You can just come at six o'clock," she replies.
I think that it always is nice to visit new friends.
"I will definitely be there," I confirm.
Eva writes her address on a small yellow note.
She hands the note to me.
"I will look forward very much to Friday," I say to her.
Eva smiles again and walks back to her computer.
